@improve_agnolia
title: Improve our relations with <span style="color: #03c2fc;">Ag</span><span style="color: #ffd000;">no</span><span style="color: #c00000;">lia</span>.
on-arrival: agnolia_relation += 1; pfjp_relation += 3; cps_relation -= 1; workers_lwusp -= 1; rural_lwusp += 1*(1 - dissent); pro_republic += 1

<span style="color: #03c2fc;">Ag</span><span style="color: #ffd000;">no</span><span style="color: #c00000;">lia</span> and <span style="color: #6e377a;">Sord</span><span style="color: #ffd000;">land</span> are longtime friends and historical allies against <span style="color: #203f80;">Rum</span><span style="color: #ffd000;">bur</span><span style="color: #000000;">gian</span> aggression. Improving our relations with them is a logical thing to do.

@improve_lespia
title: Improve our relations with <span style="color: #c00000;">Les</span><span style="color: #ffd000;">pia</span>.
on-arrival: lespia_relation += 1; pfjp_relation += 3; cps_relation -= 3; old_middle_lwusp += 1*(1 - dissent); workers_lwusp -= 1*(1 - dissent); pro_republic += 1

<span style="color: #c00000;">Les</span><span style="color: #ffd000;">pia</span> is one of the most important powers in Eastern Merkopa. Strengthening our ties with them will likely bring us closer to <span style="color: #203f80;">**ATO**</span> and might also win us a great ally.

@improve_wehlen
title: Improve our relations with <span style="color: #203f80;">Weh</span><span style="color: #c00000;">len</span>.
on-arrival: wehlen_relation += 1; cps_relation += 3; wpb_relation -= 3; bluds_lwusp -= 1; socialism += 1; nationalism += 1; pro_republic -= 2

<span style="color: #203f80;">Weh</span><span style="color: #c00000;">len</span>, our western neighbor, is a very unstable country currently ruled by the dictator Wiktor Smolak. While we could use his help, who knows when he's going to change his mind...

@improve_valgsland
title: Improve our relations with <span style="color: #03c2fc;">Val</span><span style="color: #c00000;">gsl</span><span style="color: #ffd000;">and</span>.
on-arrival: valgsland_relation += 1; cps_relation += 3; wpb_relation += 3; nfp_relation -= 3; socialism += 1

<span style="color: #03c2fc;">Val</span><span style="color: #c00000;">gsl</span><span style="color: #ffd000;">and</span> is one of the most important players in Eastern Merkopa as well as the second most powerful <span style="color: #c00000;">Communist</span> country. Investing in ties with them would grant us a valid ally and bring us closer to the <span style="color: #c00000;">**CSP**</span>.

@improve_rumburg
title: Restore our relations with <span style="color: #203f80;">Rum</span><span style="color: #ffd000;">bu</span><span style="color: #000000;">rg</span>.
on-arrival: rumburg_relation += 1; nfp_relation -= 3; rwusp_relation -= 3; rural_lwusp -= 1; old_middle_lwusp -= 1; new_middle_lwusp -= 1; bluds_lwusp += 1*(1 - dissent); nationalism += 1; pro_republic -= 1

The Kingdom of <span style="color: #203f80;">Rum</span><span style="color: #ffd000;">bu</span><span style="color: #000000;">rg</span> is our northern neighbor and longtime enemy. We might be able to restore relations, but it is generally seen as foolish to expect anything of the sort.

@merkopan_union
title: Take steps to form a "<span style="color: #001489;">Merkopan</span> <span style="color: #FFDD00;">Union</span>".
subtitle: Is a "United States of Merkopa" possible?
unavailable-subtitle: [? if lespia_relation < 6 : Our relations with Lespia are not good enough. ?] [? if agnolia_relation < 6 : Our relations with Agnolia are not good enough. ?] [? if rumburg_relation < 6 : Our relations with Rumburg are not good enough. ?]
view-if: and eu_progress < 3 and not eu and rumburg_defeated
choose-if: lespia_relation >= 6 and agnolia_relation >= 6 and rumburg_relation >= 6
on-arrival: eu_negotiation = 1; eu_progress += 1

Forming a "<span style="color: #FFDD00;">United States</span> of <span style="color: #001489;">Merkopa</span>" has long been part of the liberal democratic dream. Finally, we are taking steps towards it. Given our positive relations with the other democratic countries of <span style="color: #001489;">Merkopa</span>, we can begin to hold multilateral negotiations for more <span style="color: #001489;">Merkopan</span> <span style="color: #FFDD00;">federalism</span>. It will take time to hammer out the exact shape of this future "<span style="color: #001489;">Merkopan</span> <span style="color: #FFDD00;">Union</span>", however.


@merkopan_union_2
title: We can sign a treaty to form a <span style="color: #001489;">Merkopan</span> <span style="color: #FFDD00;">Union</span>!
view-if: eu_progress >= 3 and not eu
on-arrival: eu = 1; unemployed -= 2 if unemployed >= 10; inflation += 2 if inflation <= -2; inflation -= 1 if inflation >= 4.5; workers_lwusp += 5*(1-dissent); new_middle_lwusp += 5*(1-dissent); old_middle_lwusp += 5*(1-dissent); rural_lwusp += 4*(1-dissent); bluds_lwusp += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_lwusp += 4*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 5; nationalism -= 5; budget += 1; pfjp_relation += 5; economic_growth += 1 if economic_growth < 3; nfp_relation -= 5
max-visits: 1
achievement: eu

Along with <span style="color: #03c2fc;">Ag</span><span style="color: #ffd000;">no</span><span style="color: #c00000;">lia</span>, <span style="color: #c00000;">Les</span><span style="color: #ffd000;">pia</span> and <span style="color: #203f80;">Rum</span><span style="color: #ffd000;">bu</span><span style="color: #000000;">rg</span>, we have signed a treaty to form a <span style="color: #001489;">Merkopan</span> <span style="color: #FFDD00;">Union</span>!

A major component of the union is the free movement of people and goods across the countries of Europe, as well as the stabilization of currency exchange rates. This provides new markets for Sordish products and new sources of investment.

<span style="color: #c00000;">Communist</span> <span style="color: #03c2fc;">Val</span><span style="color: #c00000;">gsl</span><span style="color: #ffd000;">and</span> remains a problem, and most countries outside of Eastern <span style="color: #001489;">Merkopa</span> also lie outside the system. But for now, there is new hope for peace, democracy and prosperity throughout the continent.

@intermerkopum
title: Take steps to form <span style="color: #c00000;">Intermerkopum</span>, an independent left-leaning Merkopan bloc.
subtitle: Is a Intermerkopum possible?
unavailable-subtitle: [? if valgsland_relation < 6 : Our relations with Valgsland are not good enough. ?] [? if rumburg_relation < 6 : Our relations with Rumburg are not good enough. ?] [? if rumburg_relation < 6 : Our relations with Wehlen are not good enough. ?]
view-if: eu_progress < 3 and not eu and rumburg_defeated
choose-if: valgsland_relation >= 6 and wehlen_relation >= 6 and rumburg_relation >= 6
on-arrival: eu_negotiation = 1; eu_progress += 1

Forming an independent bloc has long been part of our foreign program. Finally, we are taking steps towards it. Given our positive relations with the other countries of <span style="color: #001489;">Merkopa</span>, we can begin to hold multilateral negotiations for more <span style="color: #001489;">Merkopan</span> collaboration. It will take time to hammer out the exact shape of this future <span style="color: #c00000;">Intermerkopum</span>, however.


@intermerkopum_2
title: We can sign a treaty to form <span style="color: #c00000;">Intermerkopum</span>!
view-if: eu_progress >= 3 and not eu
on-arrival: eu = 1; unemployed -= 2 if unemployed >= 10; inflation += 2 if inflation <= -2; inflation -= 1 if inflation >= 4.5; workers_spd += 5*(1-dissent); new_middle_spd += 5*(1-dissent); old_middle_spd += 5*(1-dissent); rural_spd += 4*(1-dissent); catholics_spd += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_spd += 4*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 5; nationalism -= 5; budget += 1; ddp_left += 3; ddp_cohesion += 3; ddp_relation += 10; lvp_relation += 5; foreign_goal_spd_peoples += 1; economic_growth += 1 if economic_growth < 3; kpd_coalition_dissent += 1; kpd_relation -= 10
max-visits: 1
achievement: eu

Along with <span style="color: #03c2fc;">Val</span><span style="color: #c00000;">gsl</span><span style="color: #ffd000;">and</span>, <span style="color: #203f80;">Weh</span><span style="color: #c00000;">len</span>, <span style="color: #203f80;">Rum</span><span style="color: #ffd000;">bu</span><span style="color: #000000;">rg</span>, and many other states of Eastern Merkopa, we have signed a treaty to form an independent bloc, ! It is hoped that <span style="color: #001489;">Europe</span> has learned the lessons of the Great War; never again will there be another war that tears the continent apart.

A major component of the pact is the free movement of people and goods across the countries of Europe, as well as the stabilization of currency exchange rates. This provides new markets for Sordish products and new sources of investment.

<span style="color: #03c2fc;">Capitalist</span> <span style="color: #c00000;">Les</span><span style="color: #ffd000;">pia</span> remains a problem, and our little neighbor of <span style="color: #03c2fc;">Ag</span><span style="color: #ffd000;">no</span><span style="color: #c00000;">lia</span> also lies outside the system. But for now, there is new hope for peace and prosperity throughout the continent.

